# Local scratch that is not part of the project
# Review notes, research material and unrelated documents that live in the
# maintainer's checkout. Anchored with a leading slash so a real `assets/`,
# `reference/` or `lessons/` added to the project later is not silently ignored.
.DS_Store
/.omo/
/GLOSSARY.md
/MISSION.md
/NOTES.md
/RESOURCES.md
/assets/
/learning-records/
/lessons/
/reference/
# Patent-review correspondence (ticket-numbered, not project documentation)
/回复邮件-LP*
/技术审核*稿-*.docx
